Sonara bundles icons from the Lucide icon set (https://lucide.dev).

The following files are Lucide icons, used unchanged apart from formatting:

  media/icons/tasks.svg              lucide "list-checks"
  media/icons/voice-log.svg          lucide "mic"
  media/icons/voice-transcripts.svg  lucide "file-audio"
  media/icons/review.svg             lucide "gallery-vertical-end"

None of them is derived from the Feather project, so only the ISC license below applies.

